  "native": {
    "comment": "Claude Code skills and subagents generated from repository history (design: sa workflow 2026-11-13). The costs are measured bytes on Claude Code 2.1.311 (first request, capture meter, no model call) converted at 2.46 bytes per token (2.78 for tools and system; low estimate 3.5). fixed_tokens and saved_vs_none were measured with the built-in subagents listed; builtin_agents_bytes is their listing, which deny rules Agent(<name>) remove (the env switch CLAUDE_AGENT_SDK_DISABLE_BUILTIN_AGENTS has no effect from project or local settings on 2.1.311). The gates are judgment, not measurement.",
    "measured_on": "claude-code 2.1.311",
    "basis": "sa design probe 2026-11-13 (olivium-bench-agent-pallets-click-3858:v1, capture meter, paid v2 prompt): fixed cost vs the lean profile with the built-in subagents listed (sa-c2, sa-e), less their listing (971 B, denied by name when Task is kept; capture probe 2026-11-14), plus listing bytes / 2.46",
    "prefix": "olivium-",
    "builtin_agents": [
      "Explore",
      "general-purpose",
      "statusline-setup"
    ],
